      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 660046138,
          "type": null,
          "body": "DO NOT REOPEN.  Hopefully, if I resubmit this, now that I've fixed tools/check_tfs.py not to whine about true_false_strings in plugins duplicating true_false_strings in tfs.c, it won't whine about true_false_strings in plugin/epan/gryphon/packet-gryphon.c duplicating true_false_strings in tfs.c.  It worked when I tested it, so I don't know why it didn't work when I rebased this to include that change - maybe that's not what the rebase did.",
